<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V SRI LANKA 2ND TEST DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V SRI LANKA 2ND TEST DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The second and final test between West Indies and Sri Lanka ended in a draw on Tuesday after play was called off because of bad light.</p>
<p>West Indies won the series 1-0.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 147 and 343; Sri Lanka 222 and 231-8 (A.de Silva 78, A.Ranatunga 70 not out; Walsh 4-73)</p>
